॰ Rust's `punctuation` — the sign standing alone in [आरम्भः ऽ सीमा), or ०
॰ for "not a sign". ० rather than सम्भाव्य for the reason वाक्यविभाग gives
॰ for कारक: ० is already this crate's spelling of "none" in a भेद number,
॰ and विभज below answers the same way.
॰ ॱॱ IS TESTED BEFORE ॱ AND THAT ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING — B-007. A label is
॰ written against its name, प्रारम्भःॱॱ, so a single ॱ matched first would
॰ make every label two tokens of an identifier and no label could be
॰ defined at all.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः विरामचिह्न आदाय मूल ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ ऽ आरम्भः ॱॱ न६४ ऽ सीमा ॱॱ न६४ ददाति न६४ आदि   ॰ two offsets in, a भेद out — ० for "not a sign", never −१
    चरः दैर्घ्य ॱॱ न६४ भवति आरभ्य सीमा वियोगः आरम्भः समाप्तम् ।   ॰ सीमा वियोगः आरम्भः — आरम्भः ≤ सीमा by the caller's contract

