॰ Rust's `split_trailing_punct` — कम्। is an operand and a daṇḍa, written
॰ without a space because nothing requires one. answers where the HEAD
॰ ends; सीमा when nothing is peeled.
॰ the four peelable signs are ॱॱ ऽ । ॥ and ॱ IS NOT AMONG THEM: the width
॰ suffix आहारःॱअ८ uses the same character singly and a member access has a
॰ member, so a word never ENDS in a single ॱ.
॰ STRICTLY LONGER, never equal — Rust tests `word.len() > p.len()`, so a
॰ word that IS the sign is classified whole and not peeled to nothing.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः पुच्छविरामः आदाय मूल ॱॱ अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ ऽ आरम्भः ॱॱ न६४ ऽ सीमा ॱॱ न६४ ददाति न६४ आदि   ॰ two offsets in, an offset out — सीमा when nothing is peeled
    चरः दैर्घ्य ॱॱ न६४ भवति आरभ्य सीमा वियोगः आरम्भः समाप्तम् ।   ॰ सीमा वियोगः आरम्भः, as above

