॰ ══════════════════ lex ══════════════════
॰ Rust's `lex`. Walks the source line by line; strips the comment; walks
॰ the words of what is left; peels a glued sign off each word and emits
॰ the head and then the sign, in that order and with the sign's own
॰ offsets, exactly as lex.rs does.
॰ answers HOW MANY TOKENS IT WROTE. the arena is चिह्नककोश and the count
॰ is चिह्नकसूचकाङ्क, which is reset here so that lexing a second source
॰ does not append to the first.
