    ॰ ═══ समावेशः आरभ्य <name> समाप्तम् → ONE शब्दभेद token, bytes from the store ═══
    ॰ The first of the four is rewritten in place to kind ३ with the table's bytes
    ॰ as its `पाठ`, `अष्टक` ० and `पाठसीमा` the byte count — a token's `पाठ` is the
    ॰ WHOLE run it indexes into, so a token that IS its own buffer must index from
    ॰ ०, or `ir.t1`'s literal arm slices a source offset into the wrong bytes.
    ॰ `अक्षर` and `पङ्क्ति` keep the source's, so a diagnostic still names the line.
    ॰ The three tokens after it are removed by shifting the tail down and lowering
    ॰ the CURSOR by three; the arena's length is left alone, and every reader
    ॰ walks to the cursor, never the length. An unknown name is left as four
    ॰ tokens — the parser's embed node, `ir.t1`'s cause १२ stub, the honest marker.
